# Demo app: operations and your access

Written by Aurora from the app's catalogue and your grants. The gateway decides every request;
workspace and organization policy can be stricter than this list, never looser.

## Accounts
- A: `c` L (full access)

## Read
- `gql_q` POST /graphql (GraphQL query): Query. [allowed]
- `git_f` GET /git/* (git fetch): Fetch. [allowed]
- `by_ref` GET /v1/refs (when query ref equals main): By ref. [allowed]
- `by_set` GET /v1/sets (when query kind is one of a, b and header x-team starts with core): By set. [allowed]

## Write
- `gql_m` POST /graphql (GraphQL mutation): Mutation. [allowed]
- `git_p` POST /git/* (git push): Push. [allowed]

## Requests that match no operation above
[allowed]
